1
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,000
200,000 years ago, our species lives only in Africa

2
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:19,000
Each colour of sand is a strand of ancestry

3
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Out of Africa, between 70,000 and 50,000 years ago

4
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Along the way, mixing with Neanderthals and Denisovans

5
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:17,500
At least 20,000 years ago: into the Americas

6
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:31,000
About 11,000 years ago, farming begins

7
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Steppe herders and Bantu farmers spread far

8
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:57,000
Austronesian sailors cross two oceans

9
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:20,000
1500 CE: ships, epidemics and enslavement

10
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:47,500
Today: almost every vessel holds sand from many places

11
00:02:54,500 --> 00:03:03,000
Every person alive descends from those first African grains

